BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:JERSEY CITY WRITERS: ART HOUSE JC FRIDAYS
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260911T210000
UID:86776157d7d143da80ef3ded9571a685@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Come on out on Friday\, September 11th with JC Fridays and cel
 ebrate our younger poets but don’t let their youth fool you as they can 
 throw bars with the best of them. Join Alyssa Lian and Iggy shine on the s
 tage along with SPECIAL GUEST Sean Glatch. Sean will be having a Monstrous
  poetry workshop the next day on 9/12&nbsp\;@5&nbsp\;preceded by RescuePoe
 tix and Tabitha Dial’s poetry publishing workshop&nbsp\;@2pm Alyssa Lian
  Bacay is a Filipino-American poet and memoirist from Jersey City\, New Je
 rsey. She works at New Jersey City University\, her alma mater\, at the Wr
 iting Center as a Lead Tutor\, where she has organized and hosted communit
 y writing events\, including monthly Open Mics and an annual Book Fair. He
 r work has been featured in the Jersey City Poetry Festival\, the Jersey C
 ity Museum of History\, redrosethorns journal\, and The Gothic Times. You 
 can find her at&nbsp\; @alyssalianb &nbsp\;on Instagram Iggy Manzanero is 
 a Jersey city poet whose work\, just like him\, is a product of its enviro
 nment. When he isn’t having a way with words\, the words are having thei
 r way with him. For the fans wondering where he’s been lately\, just kno
 w that metamorphosis has been really fun. Memoirs coming... eventually&nbs
 p\; THEME: OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: JERSEY CITY WRITERS FEATURES: Feature
 d Poets - Alyssa Lian &amp\; Iggy / Special Guest Sean Glatch PRICE: $10 s
 uggested donation (Cash\, Venmo\, Paypal) CONTACT: @jcwriters
LOCATION:ARTS 14C (RM 608)\, 157B 1ST STREET\, JERSEY CITY\, NJ 07302
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/art-house-jc-fridays
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
