DESCRIPTION:CONTACT @mochamicwithmillie Mocha Mic with Millie: A Rooftop E
 vening of Poetry &amp\; Music We’re taking Mocha Mic with Millie to the 
 rooftop! Join us for an evening of poetry\, music\, food\, and genuine con
 nection at @ascentjc. We are honored to partner with Ascent\, who is spons
 oring this FREE community experience and helping us create space for art\,
  culture\, and connection in Jersey City. Supported with funds by @jerseyc
 ityartscouncil This event is also part of JC Fridays - A FREE QUARTERLY CI
 TY-WIDE ARTS FESTIVAL by Art House Productions. I’m excited to welcome t
 hree incredible featured artists: Haze ( @haze_from_statefarm ) is a Queen
 s-raised\, Brooklyn-based singer/songwriter blending R&amp\;B\, Neo Soul\,
  and jazz while exploring voice\, healing\, and spirituality. 36 Chambers 
 of Poetry ( @36chambersofpoetry ) is a Philadelphia spoken word artist\, w
 riting since the 4th grade\, a member of No Philter\, and a performer whos
 e poetry has traveled as far as Trinidad &amp\; Tobago. Velvet ( @singform
 evelvet ) is a Jersey City singer\, songwriter\, and storyteller whose sou
 lful performances are rooted in connection\, nostalgia\, emotion\, and sha
 red experience. Friday\, September 11 6–9 PM @ascentjc Rooftop 500 Commu
