 two @jcwriters for a FREE multi-series workshop on bringing your poetry ma
 nuscript to life. Susan Justinian @rescuepoetix and Tabitha Dial @tabithad
 ial will guide you through the publication process. Make your piles of poe
 ms work for you. This class will help you put together your best work for 
 publication. Nurture your poetic lifeblood and connect to fellow poets as 
