BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:LetItFlow Open Mic
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T220000
UID:af8c599e36b0415d13bf5a99a1195f9e@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Name of Event: Let It Flow at the House of Playokee Date: Octo
 ber 7\, 2026 Start/End Time: 6:30 pm Address: 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union\
 , NJ Theme: Open Mic and features Host: Elijah Brown Feature(s): TBA Price
 : $20 Advance Tickets / $25 At Door - CashApp - $Elijahbr85 / Venmo - @Eli
 jahbr1985 / PAYPAL @ElijahBr0wn Phone: TEXT (862) 306-1758 Email Address: 
 &nbsp\; lifpublishing@gmail.com Website: Social Media: &nbsp\; @elijahbr85
  Event Description: &nbsp\;&nbsp\;Support doesn’t always mean buying a t
 icket. As I prepare to celebrate 21 years of hosting the Let It Flow Poetr
 y Series\, I know everyone won’t be able to attend\, and that’s okay. 
 There are still so many ways you can help make this celebration special. Y
 ou can: Purchase a ticket. Share or repost the flyer. Tag someone who love
 s live entertainment. Sponsor a ticket for someone who may not be able to 
 afford to attend. Leave a comment about your Let It Flow experience if you
 ’ve ever been to one of our shows. If you’ve never experienced Let It 
 Flow\, this is the perfect time. It’s more than poetry. It’s laughter\
 , storytelling\, live performances\, community\, and moments that stay wit
 h you long after the show ends. Whether you’re planning a girls’ night
  out\, a date night\, or just looking for something different\, you’ll l
 eave with something to talk about. And I’ll make you this promise… If 
 you come to the show and honestly don’t enjoy yourself\, I’ll personal
 ly refund your ticket. That’s how much I believe in what we’ve built o
 ver the last 21 years. Thank you to everyone who’s supported this journe
 y. Whether you’re in the room\, sharing the event\, or cheering from afa
 r\, you’ve been part of this legacy. Come Let It Flow.
LOCATION:House of Playokee\, 1050 Stuyvesant Ave\, Union NJ\, Union\, NJ
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/letitflow-open-mic-oct
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
