BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Young Artist Day at the Dodge Poetry Festival
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261016T110000
UID:d74275eec0f36a2f938bc712a9d55821@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Nothing illustrates the incredible power of words like the&nbs
 p\; Dodge Poetry Festival&nbsp\; — &nbsp\; North America’s largest cel
 ebration of poems and poets . Held every other year at NJPAC\, this joyful
  three-day gathering of writers and readers from around the country offers
  spoken word performances\, conversations with poets about their craft\, b
 ook signings and writing workshops. The Festival will also feature food tr
 ucks and a pop-up bookshop (presented by Newark’s beloved&nbsp\; Source 
 of Knowledge ). And for high school students and their teachers\,&nbsp\; i
 t’s all free! High school groups are eligible to attend &nbsp\;all dayti
 me events during the Festival’s Young Artist Day — Friday\, October 16
 \, 2026 — &nbsp\;at no cost. Teachers or administrators simply need to c
 omplete an online registration process.&nbsp\; The 2026&nbsp\; Dodge Poetr
 y Festival &nbsp\;will present state and national Poets Laureate\, Pulitze
 r Prize winners\, slam champions and some of the most talented emerging po
 ets working today\, including: U.S. Poet Laureate&nbsp\; Arthur Sze \; Pul
 itzer Prize winner&nbsp\; Tyehimba Jess \; best-selling young-adult noveli
 st and poet &nbsp\;Elizabeth Acevedo &nbsp\;( The Poet X )\; poet and youn
 gest-ever Nuyorican Poets Café Grand Slam Champion\, &nbsp\;Aja Monet \; 
 Palestinian American poet and songwriter &nbsp\;Naomi Shihab Nye \; and ma
 ny more. Get students excited about reading\, writing and sharing their st
 ories at the&nbsp\; 2026 Dodge Poetry Festival&nbsp\; by registering to at
 tend today! THEME: Youth Artist Day HOST: NJPAC FEATURES: U.S. Poet Laurea
 te&nbsp\; Arthur Sze \; Pulitzer Prize winner&nbsp\; Tyehimba Jess \; best
 -selling young-adult novelist and poet &nbsp\;Elizabeth Acevedo &nbsp\;( T
 he Poet X )\; poet and youngest-ever Nuyorican Poets Café Grand Slam Cham
 pion\, &nbsp\;Aja Monet \; Palestinian American poet and songwriter &nbsp\
 ;Naomi Shihab Nye \; and many more. PRICE: FREE RSVP - https://www.njpac.o
 rg/education-program/young-artist-day-at-the-dodge-poetry-festival/ CONTAC
 T: IG - @njpac / FB - NJPAC
LOCATION:NJPAC\, 1 Center Street\, Newark\, NJ\, 07102
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/young-artist-day-at-the-dodge-
 poetry-festival
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
